{
  "name": "cutout",
  "label": "Cutout",
  "description": "Construction paper and scissors, like a cutout cartoon: a sky of blue paper over snowy paper hills, or a night sky with paper stars after dark. Everything is cut from fibrous paper in flat colors, with uneven scissor-cut corners and a small shadow where one sheet sits on another. Titles are chunky letters cut out with a white margin; keys are paper scraps that pop up a frame at a time; badges and tooltips are torn strips; avatars are paper circles; progress is a strip of paper being glued on.",
